        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_27"/>
        <dc:title>Mapping the Authoritarian Movement: Part Four - The Far-Right Network of Think Tanks</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>With Trump’s return to the White House, GPAHE is publishing a special four-part series on the network of major far-right think tanks and their principals who most influence the new administration. In this final piece, GPAHE investigates the far-right network as a whole, identifying the major organizations and individuals with the most “influence,” meaning how connected they are to other influential nodes in the Trump orbit.</dcterms:abstract>
